    "detailed_description": "<h1>Other Games From Chilla's Art</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>Other Games From Chilla's Art</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>Other Games From Chilla's Art</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>Other Games From Chilla's Art</h1><p></p><br><h1>UPCOMING GAMES</h1><p><br><br> (Published &amp; Developed by NyxTales)</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267310/extras/50cea74e2f11167a7da987cf7c74923c.poster.avif?t=1662352138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267310/extras/50cea74e2f11167a7da987cf7c74923c.webm?t=1662352138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267310/extras/50cea74e2f11167a7da987cf7c74923c.mp4?t=1662352138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>From the creators of   <br><br><strong>Onryo | \u6028\u970a</strong> is a survival action horror game set in Japan. Your mission is to exorcise the haunted house by killing enemies with a special camera.<br><br><i>We recommend you wear headphones. Without it, it will be extremely hard to tell where the ghosts are. </i><br><i>The game can be difficult for some players. Be patient and observe enemy patterns and behaviors. </i><br><i>The playtime is around 90 ~ 120 minutes long, depending on your skill and playstyle.</i><br><br><br><strong>Save system</strong>: We finally have a save system.<br><br><strong>Immersive experience</strong>: An atmospheric, realistic graphics intensifies the horror experience.<br><br><strong>Japanese Theme</strong>: Japanese horror films inspired environment.<br><br><strong>Camera-based action</strong>: You use a special camera to defeat enemies.<br><br><strong>Exploration</strong>: As you explore the house and uncover its secrets, you'll be faced with puzzles.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267310/extras/50cea74e2f11167a7da987cf7c74923c.poster.avif?t=1662352138\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267310/extras/50cea74e2f11167a7da987cf7c74923c.webm?t=1662352138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267310/extras/50cea74e2f11167a7da987cf7c74923c.mp4?t=1662352138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>From the creators of   <br><br><strong>Onryo | \u6028\u970a</strong> is a survival action horror game set in Japan. Your mission is to exorcise the haunted house by killing enemies with a special camera.<br><br><i>We recommend you wear headphones. Without it, it will be extremely hard to tell where the ghosts are. </i><br><i>The game can be difficult for some players. Be patient and observe enemy patterns and behaviors. </i><br><i>The playtime is around 90 ~ 120 minutes long, depending on your skill and playstyle.</i><br><br><br><strong>Save system</strong>: We finally have a save system.<br><br><strong>Immersive experience</strong>: An atmospheric, realistic graphics intensifies the horror experience.<br><br><strong>Japanese Theme</strong>: Japanese horror films inspired environment.<br><br><strong>Camera-based action</strong>: You use a special camera to defeat enemies.<br><br><strong>Exploration</strong>: As you explore the house and uncover its secrets, you'll be faced with puzzles.",
    "short_description": "Onryo | \u6028\u970a is a survival action horror game set in Japan. Your mission is to lift the curse of a haunted house using your exorcistic camera. As you explore the house and uncover its secrets, you will face enemies and puzzles.",
